# Experiment 8 - Email Spoofing Detection using Random Forest

## Aim
To detect spoofed emails using the Random Forest classification algorithm.

## Algorithm
Random Forest Classifier

## Libraries Used
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn

## Description
The program uses email-related features such as domain matching, SPF, DKIM and suspicious indicators to classify emails as genuine or spoofed.

## Output
Displays the predicted status of sample emails.
